  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** The TON network’s recent Catchain 2.0 upgrade dramatically improved performance—slashing block times and transaction fees while boosting throughput tenfold. This has already ignited a surge in staking activity, with April rewards more than tripling over March, directly benefiting TONX as a major staking participant. The company holds a sizable fraction of the total and staked supply, giving it concentrated exposure to ecosystem growth. Increased network efficiency is designed to attract higher transaction volumes, reinforcing the flywheel between network usage and staking economics that underpins the company’s value proposition.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership is executing a transparent, debt-free digital-asset treasury strategy, actively staking nearly all holdings to generate recurring token rewards. The decision to support network fee reductions and highlight technical upgrades signals a hands-on approach to nurturing the TON ecosystem’s adoption. With quarterly updates emphasizing holdings growth and post-quarter appreciation, management is building a straightforward narrative of disciplined accumulation and yield generation—though the story relies almost entirely on company-issued materials, which naturally present a bullish tilt.",
